{"seq":3,"slug":"lithium-sulfur-air","title":"锂硫与锂空气电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/next-gen-batteries/lithium-sulfur-air","wordCount":2055,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"锂硫与锂空气电池\">锂硫与锂空气电池</h1><p>在所有&quot;下一代&quot;电池技术中，锂硫和锂空气电池代表了能量密度的理论极限——分别达到 2600 Wh/kg 和 3500 Wh/kg，是当前锂电池的 5-10 倍。但理论极限与工程现实之间横亘着巨大的鸿沟：穿梭效应、枝晶生长、催化剂失活等问题使这两项技术仍停留在 TRL 3-5 阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>锂硫与锂空气代表能量密度的理论极限，也代表工程现实与理论之间最大的鸿沟。核心概念围绕&quot;为什么理论这么高、实际这么难&quot;展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>理论极限的来源</strong>：锂金属负极（3860 mAh/g）与轻质正极（硫 1675 mAh/g，或空气中取氧）的组合，使理论比能量达到锂电池的 5-10 倍——正极&quot;越轻越好&quot;是核心思路。</li>\n<li><strong>多电子反应的代价</strong>：硫的放电经历多步多硫化物中间态（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>S</mtext><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>S</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{S}_8 \\to \\text{Li}_2\\text{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span></span></span></span></span>），中间产物溶解穿梭；锂空气的 ORR/OER 涉及四电子转移且动力学极慢——反应越复杂，副反应和能量损失越多。</li>\n<li><strong>穿梭效应</strong>：长链多硫化物在正负极间溶解迁移，造成自放电、活性硫损失和低库伦效率，是锂硫电池的&quot;致命伤&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>开放体系的额外难题</strong>：锂空气电池从空气中取氧，同时也不可避免地引入水分和 CO₂，生成不可逆副产物，需要空气纯化系统。</li>\n<li><strong>TRL 与技术成熟度</strong>：锂硫处于 TRL 5（液态）、锂空气处于 TRL 3，距离商业化分别约 3-5 年和 10-15 年——TRL 是判断&quot;何时能用&quot;的客观标尺。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个常见误解：把&quot;理论能量密度&quot;当作&quot;实验室已达指标&quot;。锂硫理论 2600 Wh/kg，实际电芯仅 300-500 Wh/kg，且循环寿命仅 100-500 圈，离车用要求相去甚远。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锂硫电池的能量密度优势\">锂硫电池的能量密度优势</h2><p>锂硫电池使用锂金属负极和单质硫正极，总反应为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>Li</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>S</mtext><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>S</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{Li} + \\text{S} \\to \\text{Li}_2\\text{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li>硫的理论比容量：1675 mAh/g（是 NCM811 的 8 倍）</li>\n<li>锂金属比容量：3860 mAh/g（是石墨的 10 倍）</li>\n<li>理论能量密度：2600 Wh/kg（电芯级）</li>\n<li>工作电压：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>2.1V（低于锂电的 3.2-4.2V）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>硫的另一大优势是地壳丰度极高（0.06%），作为石油脱硫副产物几乎零成本。如果锂硫电池商业化成功，材料成本可降至现有锂电的 1/5-1/3。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>锂硫（理论）</th>\n<th>锂硫（实际，2025）</th>\n<th>NCM811 锂电</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>比能量</td>\n<td>2600 Wh/kg</td>\n<td>300-500 Wh/kg</td>\n<td>280-300 Wh/kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环寿命</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>100-500 圈</td>\n<td>1000-2000 圈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电压</td>\n<td>2.1V</td>\n<td>1.8-2.3V</td>\n<td>3.6-4.2V</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能量效率</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>85-92%</td>\n<td>95-99%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硫利用率</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>50-70%</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"穿梭效应-锂硫电池的致命伤\">穿梭效应：锂硫电池的致命伤</h2><p>锂硫电池放电过程并非一步到位，而是经历多级中间产物（多硫化物）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>S</mtext><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>S</mtext><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>S</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>S</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>S</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>S</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{S}_8 \\to \\text{Li}_2\\text{S}_8 \\to \\text{Li}_2\\text{S}_6 \\to \\text{Li}_2\\text{S}_4 \\to \\text{Li}_2\\text{S}_2 \\to \\text{Li}_2\\text{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>长链多硫化物（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>S</mtext><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Li}_2\\text{S}_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\geq 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>）可溶于电解液，在正负极之间来回&quot;穿梭&quot;：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[硫正极] --&gt;|放电生成| B[长链多硫化物]&#10;    B --&gt;|溶解扩散| C[电解液]&#10;    C --&gt;|迁移到| D[锂负极]&#10;    D --&gt;|被还原为| E[短链多硫化物]&#10;    E --&gt;|回迁到| A&#10;    D --&gt;|不可逆沉积| F[Li₂S/Li₂S₂ 钝化层]&#10;    F --&gt; G[负极钝化 + 容量衰减]\">graph LR\n    A[硫正极] --&gt;|放电生成| B[长链多硫化物]\n    B --&gt;|溶解扩散| C[电解液]\n    C --&gt;|迁移到| D[锂负极]\n    D --&gt;|被还原为| E[短链多硫化物]\n    E --&gt;|回迁到| A\n    D --&gt;|不可逆沉积| F[Li₂S/Li₂S₂ 钝化层]\n    F --&gt; G[负极钝化 + 容量衰减]</pre><p>穿梭效应的三重危害：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>自放电加速</strong>：多硫化物在负极被还原等同于内部短路</li>\n<li><strong>活性硫损失</strong>：不可逆 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>S</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Li}_2\\text{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span></span></span></span></span> 沉积在负极表面</li>\n<li><strong>库伦效率低</strong>：每圈 CE 仅 85-95%（锂电 &gt;99.9%）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"穿梭抑制策略\">穿梭抑制策略</h2><p>学术界和产业界提出了多种应对方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略类别</th>\n<th>具体方案</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碳基硫宿主</td>\n<td>介孔碳、CNT、石墨烯</td>\n<td>物理限域多硫化物</td>\n<td>中（仍有泄漏）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极性吸附</td>\n<td>TiO₂、MnO₂、MoS₂ 修饰碳</td>\n<td>化学键合多硫化物</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能化隔膜</td>\n<td>MOF/GO 涂覆隔膜</td>\n<td>选择性阻挡多硫化物</td>\n<td>有效但增重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电解液设计</td>\n<td>高浓度醚基电解液（DOL/DME）</td>\n<td>降低多硫化物溶解度</td>\n<td>有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固态电解质</td>\n<td>硫化物/氧化物 SE</td>\n<td>完全阻断穿梭</td>\n<td>最有效但引入界面问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>催化转化</td>\n<td>钴/镍催化剂加速 S₈→Li₂S</td>\n<td>减少中间态停留时间</td>\n<td>有效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>目前最有前景的方向是&quot;多策略协同&quot;：碳基宿主（物理限域）+ 极性材料（化学吸附）+ 功能隔膜（传输阻挡）+ 电催化层（加速转化），将硫利用率从 50% 提升至 80%+，循环稳定性从 100 圈提升至 500+ 圈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锂空气电池-开放体系的极限挑战\">锂空气电池：开放体系的极限挑战</h2><p>锂空气电池以氧气（来自空气）作为正极活性物质，理论上不需要携带正极材料重量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>Li</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>↔</mo><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2.96</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{Li} + \\text{O}_2 \\leftrightarrow \\text{Li}_2\\text{O}_2 \\quad E^0 = 2.96\\text{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0141em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.96</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>理论能量密度高达 3500 Wh/kg（含氧质量）或 11000+ Wh/kg（不含氧），接近汽油的能量密度。</p>\n<p>但锂空气电池面临比锂硫更严峻的挑战：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>严重程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ORR/OER 过电位大</td>\n<td>氧还原/析出动力学极慢</td>\n<td>充放电电压差 &gt;1V，能量效率 &lt;70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放电产物不溶不导</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Li}_2\\text{O}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 沉积堵塞多孔电极</td>\n<td>容量受限于孔体积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空气中水分/CO₂</td>\n<td>生成 LiOH/Li₂CO₃ 不可逆</td>\n<td>需空气纯化系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锂负极不稳定</td>\n<td>枝晶 + 电解液消耗</td>\n<td>循环寿命极短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电解液分解</td>\n<td>有机溶剂被氧/超氧自由基攻击</td>\n<td>寿命仅数十圈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"orr-oer-催化剂研究\">ORR/OER 催化剂研究</h2><p>氧还原反应（ORR）和氧析出反应（OER）是锂空气电池正极的核心电化学过程。由于这两个反应动力学极慢（Tafel 斜率 &gt;120 mV/dec），需要高效催化剂：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>催化剂类型</th>\n<th>代表材料</th>\n<th>ORR 活性</th>\n<th>OER 活性</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>贵金属</td>\n<td>Pt、Ru、Ir</td>\n<td>极好</td>\n<td>好（RuO₂）</td>\n<td>中（溶解）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过渡金属氧化物</td>\n<td>MnO₂、Co₃O₄</td>\n<td>良</td>\n<td>良</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碳基催化剂</td>\n<td>N-掺杂碳、CNT</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钙钛矿</td>\n<td>La₀.₈Sr₀.₂MnO₃</td>\n<td>良</td>\n<td>优</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单原子催化剂</td>\n<td>Fe-N-C、Co-N-C</td>\n<td>优</td>\n<td>良</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>双功能催化剂（同时高效催化 ORR 和 OER）是实现高能量效率循环的关键。目前最佳催化体系可将充放电电压差从 &gt;1.5V 压缩至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>0.8V，将往返效率从 60% 提升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>75%。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[锂空气电池正极] --&gt; B[放电: ORR]&#10;    A --&gt; C[充电: OER]&#10;    B --&gt; D[O₂ + 2Li⁺ + 2e⁻ → Li₂O₂]&#10;    C --&gt; E[Li₂O₂ → O₂ + 2Li⁺ + 2e⁻]&#10;    D --&gt; F[过电位 0.3-0.5V]&#10;    E --&gt; G[过电位 0.5-1.0V]&#10;    F --&gt; H[催化剂降低能垒]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[目标: 总过电位 &lt; 0.6V]\">graph TD\n    A[锂空气电池正极] --&gt; B[放电: ORR]\n    A --&gt; C[充电: OER]\n    B --&gt; D[O₂ + 2Li⁺ + 2e⁻ → Li₂O₂]\n    C --&gt; E[Li₂O₂ → O₂ + 2Li⁺ + 2e⁻]\n    D --&gt; F[过电位 0.3-0.5V]\n    E --&gt; G[过电位 0.5-1.0V]\n    F --&gt; H[催化剂降低能垒]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[目标: 总过电位 &lt; 0.6V]</pre><h2 id=\"商业化距离评估\">商业化距离评估</h2><p>锂硫和锂空气电池的技术成熟度（TRL）评估：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>当前 TRL</th>\n<th>关键瓶颈</th>\n<th>可能商业化时间</th>\n<th>首发应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>锂硫（液态）</td>\n<td>TRL 5</td>\n<td>穿梭效应、寿命短</td>\n<td>2028-2030</td>\n<td>无人机、航空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锂硫（固态 SE）</td>\n<td>TRL 3-4</td>\n<td>界面 + 硫利用率</td>\n<td>2032+</td>\n<td>特种应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锂空气（非水系）</td>\n<td>TRL 3</td>\n<td>电解液分解、寿命</td>\n<td>2035+</td>\n<td>军事/航天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锂空气（固态）</td>\n<td>TRL 2-3</td>\n<td>全部问题叠加</td>\n<td>2040+</td>\n<td>研究探索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>英国 Oxis Energy 曾是锂硫电池商业化的先锋（达到 400 Wh/kg 软包电芯），但于 2021 年因资金链断裂而倒闭——这说明即使技术层面取得突破，商业化路径仍充满不确定性。</p>\n<p>当前更现实的定位是：锂硫作为特种应用（高空无人机、平流层通信、军用）的候选技术，在这些场景中对循环寿命要求低（&lt;100 圈）但对重量极其敏感。锂空气则更多作为基础科学研究方向，距离实用化仍需 10-15 年的根本性突破。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>锂硫（2600 Wh/kg）和锂空气（3500 Wh/kg）代表能量密度的理论极限，来源于轻质正极（硫/氧）加锂金属负极的组合。</li>\n<li>锂硫的核心瓶颈是穿梭效应，导致自放电、活性硫损失和低库伦效率，需&quot;宿主+吸附+隔膜+催化&quot;多策略协同抑制。</li>\n<li>锂空气面临 ORR/OER 过电位大、产物不溶、空气中水分/CO₂ 副反应、电解液分解等更严峻的多重挑战。</li>\n<li>催化剂（尤其双功能催化剂）是提升锂空气往返效率的关键，目标将充放电电压差压缩至 0.6V 以内。</li>\n<li>两者 TRL 分别为 5 和 3，更现实的近期定位是特种应用，而非主流车用储能。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"锂硫与锂空气电池","id":"锂硫与锂空气电池"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"锂硫电池的能量密度优势","id":"锂硫电池的能量密度优势"},{"level":2,"text":"穿梭效应：锂硫电池的致命伤","id":"穿梭效应-锂硫电池的致命伤"},{"level":2,"text":"穿梭抑制策略","id":"穿梭抑制策略"},{"level":2,"text":"锂空气电池：开放体系的极限挑战","id":"锂空气电池-开放体系的极限挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"ORR/OER 催化剂研究","id":"orr-oer-催化剂研究"},{"level":2,"text":"商业化距离评估","id":"商业化距离评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"钠离子电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/next-gen-batteries/sodium-ion-batteries"},"next":{"title":"电化学储能电站","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/grid-scale-storage/electrochemical-storage-stations"}}